{"id": "en_wildfire_road_p2", "total": 69.87, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Unbearable radiant heat forces Cole to seek shelter inside his trapped vehicle.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.62}, {"text": "Orange flames surround the car while heavy smoke drastically reduces visibility in the dusk air.", "start": 5.18, "end": 8.94}, {"text": "One. If trapped in a car, park in an area clear of vegetation immediately.", "start": 8.83, "end": 13.42}, {"text": "Cole quickly moves the vehicle onto a patch of dirt completely clear of thick bushes.", "start": 12.73, "end": 16.78}, {"text": "Two. Close all the windows and air vents tightly to block out toxic smoke.", "start": 16.59, "end": 20.5}, {"text": "Cole seals every single opening inside the car to keep the dangerous gases out.", "start": 20.25, "end": 23.8}, {"text": "Three. Keep the engine running so the vehicle systems and air filters function.", "start": 23.610000000000003, "end": 27.46}, {"text": "Cole leaves the engine running while thick smoke billows violently against the glass windows.", "start": 27.09, "end": 31.08}, {"text": "Four. Get down on the floor and cover yourself with a wool blanket or jacket.", "start": 30.885, "end": 34.68}, {"text": "Cole drops flat onto the floorboards and pulls a heavy wool blanket over his body.", "start": 34.47, "end": 38.26}, {"text": "The car remains much safer than running on foot through the fast moving firestorm.", "start": 38.88, "end": 41.7}, {"text": "Blinding flames roar past the vehicle while interior temperatures rise to dangerous levels.", "start": 42.38, "end": 45.88}, {"text": "He stays low on the floor until the loud wall of fire finally passes over.", "start": 46.38, "end": 49.4}, {"text": "The vehicle holds strong against the extreme heat because Cole followed every safety rule.", "start": 50.04, "end": 53.782}, {"text": "Wildfires move with terrifying speed, but smart survival choices keep you alive every time.", "start": 54.06, "end": 58.16}, {"text": "Never wait to evacuate when officials issue warnings in your local forest area.", "start": 58.8, "end": 61.56}, {"text": "Always leave early when told to evacuate because waiting is the most dangerous choice.", "start": 62.06, "end": 65.06}, {"text": "Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 65.6, "end": 66.72}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.26], ["two.", 0.228, 0.457], ["Unbearable", 1.32, 1.72], ["radiant", 1.72, 2.02], ["heat", 2.02, 2.28], ["forces", 2.28, 2.62], ["Cole", 2.2899999999999996, 2.1], ["to", 2.86, 2.98], ["seek", 2.98, 3.16], ["shelter", 3.16, 3.44], ["inside", 3.44, 3.82], ["his", 3.82, 4.08], ["trapped", 4.08, 4.3], ["vehicle.", 4.3, 4.62], ["Orange", 5.18, 5.34], ["flames", 5.34, 5.56], ["surround", 5.56, 5.9], ["the", 5.9, 6.08], ["car", 6.08, 6.26], ["while", 6.26, 6.46], ["heavy", 6.46, 6.68], ["smoke", 6.68, 6.86], ["drastically", 6.86, 7.36], ["reduces", 7.36, 7.72], ["visibility", 7.72, 8.12], ["in", 8.12, 8.5], ["the", 8.5, 8.58], ["dusk", 8.58, 8.82], ["air.", 8.82, 8.94], ["One.", 8.83, 8.769], ["If", 10.44, 10.54], ["trapped", 10.54, 10.72], ["in", 10.72, 10.88], ["a", 10.88, 10.92], ["car,", 10.92, 11.08], ["park", 11.42, 11.56], ["in", 11.56, 11.62], ["an", 11.62, 11.74], ["area", 11.74, 11.9], ["clear", 11.9, 12.18], ["of", 12.18, 12.38], ["vegetation", 12.38, 12.72], ["immediately.", 12.72, 13.42], ["Cole", 12.73, 12.185], ["quickly", 14.18, 14.48], ["moves", 14.48, 14.64], ["the", 14.64, 14.78], ["vehicle", 14.78, 14.98], ["onto", 14.98, 15.2], ["a", 15.2, 15.32], ["patch", 15.32, 15.46], ["of", 15.46, 15.6], ["dirt", 15.6, 15.66], ["completely", 15.66, 16.04], ["clear", 16.04, 16.36], ["of", 16.36, 16.46], ["thick", 16.46, 16.58], ["bushes.", 16.58, 16.78], ["Two.", 16.59, 16.109], ["Close", 18.22, 18.32], ["all", 18.32, 18.52], ["the", 18.52, 18.58], ["windows", 18.58, 18.78], ["and", 18.78, 18.96], ["air", 18.96, 19.06], ["vents", 19.06, 19.16], ["tightly", 19.16, 19.5], ["to", 19.5, 19.64], ["block", 19.64, 19.8], ["out", 19.8, 20.0],